{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["כי בענן אראה על הכפרת — by its plain sense: for from within the pillar of cloud I am seen at every moment upon the kapporet, as it is written: ״ודברתי אתך מעל הכפורת מבין שני הכרובים״ — and if the priest sees, he dies. Therefore when he enters on the Day of Atonements, the Holy One, blessed be He, commanded him to burn incense inside first, to darken the house with the cloud of incense, and afterward he brings the blood of the bull and the blood of the goat."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:48:53.016207622Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}